              "tweet_ids": [
                5,
                7,
                8
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "On March 16, people were evacuated from Ashfell bench and service disruptions were reported in Ashfell bench and the upper bench.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                56,
                59,
                63
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "On March 17, information was provided about the tailings dam and pond, while service disruptions were reported at Corvane mine and the pit.",
